0,Aymara people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aymara_people,"The Aymara or Aimara (Aymara: aymara, listen ⓘ) people are an Indigenous people in the Andes and Altiplano regions of South America. Approximately 2.3 million Aymara live in northwest Argentina, Bolivia, Chile, and Peru. The Aymara have lived in the region for over 7,250 years.","Aymara, Southern",Aymaran
